    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Integrated Stand feature, 1st level.</em></p><p>Spend 1 action to merge the stand with you, or to separate it into an adjacent space. While merged, it shares your space, your unarmed Strikes use the stand's attack modifier and damage, and Act Together actions happen from your space. While merged, you share the stand's ghostly body: you gain its ghostly resistance (half your level, minimum 1, to all damage except force, spirit and ghost touch).</p>",
